":{"login":"jerpelea","id":7842698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NDI2OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7842698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea","html_url":"https://github.com/jerpelea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T07:53:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T07:53:18Z","body":"@jlovejoy sorry for missing your message \nthe project uses various files which have old Public domain statements. \nAll those files are marked by the project as \"NuttX-PublicDomain\" following the Fedora does \n\nBest regards\nAlin","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2820477608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2902408746","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665#issuecomment-2902408746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665","id":2902408746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86s_z4q","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T19:59:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T19:59:28Z","body":"The project should mark the files with LicenseRef-NuttX-PublicDomain. There are no local SPDX identifiers.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2902408746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3116345453","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665#issuecomment-3116345453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665","id":3116345453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE865v6ht","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T04:26:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T04:26:50Z","body":"Hi @jerpelea - apologies again! I have finally looked at the https://github.com/apache/nuttx/tree/master repo more closely.  Looks like you all have inserted the SPDX license identifiers in all the source files, along with whatever license text was there, as well as compiling all the license texts into LICENSE, including the list of files for each license text. (impressive amount of work!)\n\nFor files that had some form of public domain dedication - it looks like you left that text in the file, included such text in the LICENSE file, and added an SPDX identifier of `NuttX-PublicDomain`\n\nThis is sort of similar to what Fedora does with a couple key differences:\n1) as @karsten-klein pointed out, `NuttX-PublicDomain` is not a valid SPDX identifier, but you could use  - `LicenseRef-NuttX-PublicDomain` which is how to create a valid SPDX license identifier for things that are not on the SPDX License List\n2) Fedora has taken the approach of \"collecting\" public domain dedications in one text file and then using ``LicenseRef-Fedora-Public-Domain` (see https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/blob/main/public-domain-text.txt?ref_type=heads for more details) Note: Fedora took this novel approach to avoid submitting many, many variants of public domain dedications to the SPDX License List for review, resulting in many, many new identifiers - but while wanting to retain recognition that something existed in the files. \n\nIf the NuttX project wants to adopt a similar approach, I'd suggest considering grouping the items that use the `LicenseRef-NuttX-PublicDomain` identifier in the LICENSE text file, and documenting an explanation of this approach somewhere (which could be in a heading for that section of the LICENSE file). But in any case, `NuttX-PublicDomain` is not eligible to submit to the SPDX License List  because it represents a collection of \"license\" texts. \n\nIf you want more info on the Fedora approach - feel free to reach out and we can find a time to chat!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3116345453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3116347412","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665#issuecomment-3116347412","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665","id":3116347412,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE865v7AU","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T04:28:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T04:28:01Z","body":"(using the \"general question\" label as a reminder that I responded here and that this has to do with a broader question)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3116347412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3582506996","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665#issuecomment-3582506996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665","id":3582506996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE87ViLf0","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T17:39:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T17:39:52Z","body":"@jerpelea - checking back here! I am not sure I clarified in my previous comments that SPDX ids are 1:1, meaning 1 ID is representative of a specific set of text. You are using one ID to represent a variety of text expressions. So, there isn't really a license text to add to the list. \n\nI marked this as a general question b/c we had contemplated reconsidering how SPDX handles this kind of thing / considering something akin to what Fedora has done, but that didn't get any traction. However, that would a massive change, break a lot of things, introduce challenges for tooling, etc. There doesn't seem to be support for that at this time, so I may close this issue.\n\nHowever, please do use `LicenseRef-NuttX-PublicDomain` (hopefully that involves a somewhat easy find/replace!) because `NuttX-PublicDomain` is not a valid SPDX id, so it will fail tests for SPDX spec compliance.\n\nI'll leave this issue open for a few more days to make sure you have had a chance to see it!\n\nAlso - feel free to reach out to spdx-legal via the mailing list, if you or anyone else in the NuttX project needs any help related to this or other SPDX license id questions","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3582506996/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3596708743","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665#issuecomment-3596708743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2665","id":3596708743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE87WYWuH","user":{"login":"jerpelea","id":7842698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NDI2OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7842698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea","html_url":"https://github.com/jerpelea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerpelea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T14:00:52Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T14:04:11Z","body":"@jlovejoy sorry for missing your message \n\nI can replace the current string in the NuttX sources to LicenseRef-NuttX-PublicDomain before the next release.\n\nWe got inspiration from the Fedora approach but we decided to keep the licenses in place for sources\n\nThanks for the detailed explanation ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3596708743/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]